import Game.Levels.Projection.L06_GramSchmidtBoss

World "Projection"
Title "Projection"

Introduction "
Hefferon Three.VI. Projecting a vector into a line splits it into a part along the line and a
part orthogonal to it. Repeating this is the Gram–Schmidt process, which turns any basis into an
orthogonal one — and, as Sheet 8 shows, can go badly wrong in floating point.
"
